-- statement:
--   Original negative-mark payoff integral is almost-everywhere strongly measurable at every strict preterminal horizon for cap top, with the exact source process and filtration. Finite cap physical theorem phys49 supplies the analogous fact for finite C; adapt its deterministic uniform bound to top cap.
